1785
01:56:16,393 --> 01:56:18,979
Who was the fucking rat?

1786
01:56:25,277 --> 01:56:27,070
It was the boy!

1787
01:56:29,239 --> 01:56:31,074
The boy from San Miguel.

1788
01:56:32,242 --> 01:56:33,660
Atta boy,

1789
01:56:34,745 --> 01:56:36,079
