"Little Devil," that's all.

1793
01:56:58,727 --> 01:56:59,770
…Little Devil.

1794
01:57:02,648 --> 01:57:03,649
Let's see, whiteys.

1795
01:57:04,483 --> 01:57:06,693
Since you are both from San Miguel,

1796
01:57:08,153 --> 01:57:09,988
